          "title_zh": "mu-bench：多语言话语转写基准",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2609.32082v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_other",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2609.32082",
          "summary": "The authors release mu-bench, 4,270 caller utterances from 250 phone calls to an AI banking agent in English, Spanish, Turkish, Vietnamese, and Mandarin, centered on form-field inputs such as names and email addresses, along with an LLM-judged Utterance Error Rate metric calibrated against human raters. UER agrees with annotators at kappa = 0.78 versus 0.53 for normalized exact-match WER, and on a leaderboard of six commercial providers the best reaches 11.9% UER, with Mandarin hardest for all six.",
