          "title_zh": "人类何时应收回控制权？动荡 AI 风险下的最优委托",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2609.32083v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_other",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2609.32083",
          "summary": "The paper formulates adaptive human oversight of AI as a continuous-time stochastic control problem in which failures cluster through self-exciting dynamics, jointly deciding monitoring effort and switching between human-AI operation and full delegation. It proposes Hawkes-PPO, a policy-gradient method using a bank of exponential filters of incident times, which in a synthetic environment attains a higher risk-adjusted objective than either fixed regime and approaches an approximate full-information oracle.",
